  "title": "Dead Man's Switch",
  "description": "Aztechnology HQ corporate infiltration. A whistleblower stashed evidence in the executive suite. Get the data, eliminate corp security, and extract from the rooftop before lockdown.",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "briefing": "Aztechnology \u2014 the worst of the Big Ten, and we're about to walk right into their downtown HQ. A whistleblower exec named Carlos Santiago triggered a dead-man switch before they got him. Evidence of corp blood-magic experiments is sitting on a terminal in the executive suite, 17th floor. Take the lobby, grab the data, and exfil from the helipad. Aztechnology's head of security \u2014 Vera Koss \u2014 will be waiting up top; she's the wall between you and the heli, so put her down hard. You've got six minutes before the building goes into hard lockdown \u2014 anything still inside after that gets sealed in with the cleanup squad.",
  "missionCompleteSummary": "Evidence package delivered to the news drop. Aztechnology blood-magic program leaked to every newsfeed in the Sprawl by morning. Heat is going to be insane for a few weeks \u2014 lay low, change SINs, and watch your back. Worth it.",
